@startuml
title Deferred Seat Confirmation During Customer Checkout

hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 45
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor Customer
participant CustomerApplication as Application
participant CustomerUi as Ui
participant Bill
participant SeatStorage as Seats
database "seats.tsv" as SeatsFile

note over Customer, Application
Pricing and catalog are loaded and the customer has selected a screening.
end note

Customer -> Ui : select seats
Ui --> Application : requested seat coordinates
Application -> Ui : show tentative seats and request confirmation
Customer -> Ui : confirm tentative seats
Ui --> Application : confirmed seat set

note right of Application
Tentative seats are held only in memory. No persistent occupancy is changed.
end note

Application -> Ui : collect ticket, snack/combo, and promotion selections
Customer -> Ui : completed selections
Ui --> Application : immutable selection snapshots
Application -> Bill : new Bill(ticket, snacks, promotion)
Application -> Ui : renderBill(bill, movie, screening)
Ui --> Application : complete bill text in memory

note right of Application
Required order: render bill in memory, then persist seats, then display the bill.
end note

Application -> Seats : confirmSeats(screeningId, seats, knownIds)
Seats -> SeatsFile : reload and validate occupancy

alt selected seat is now taken
    Seats --> Application : SeatStorageException (conflict)
    Application -> Ui : report conflict and return to seat selection
    note right of Application
    Do not display the bill. Do not change occupancy.
    end note
else other storage failure
    Seats --> Application : SeatStorageException
    Application -> Ui : report storage failure
    note right of Application
    End the unfinished purchase at the post-session prompt.
    end note
else seats remain available
    Seats -> SeatsFile : write complete state to temp file; force; atomic replace
    SeatsFile --> Seats : persistence succeeds
    Seats --> Application : success
    Application -> Ui : writeBill(already-rendered text)
    Ui --> Customer : itemized bill
end
@enduml
